      "observed": "The MAX3485 VCC pin (U1 pin 8) is wired straight to the +3V3 power symbol with no decoupling capacitor attached, and no reference designator C5 (or any 0.1 µF cap) appears anywhere on the sheet; the only capacitors drawn are C1–C4 (100 µF) on the servo rail.",
