      ],
      "impact": "Without the specified high-frequency bypass on the MAX3485 supply, the transceiver's VCC rail is undecoupled, which can cause supply noise, ringing/oscillation and unreliable half-duplex serial-servo communication (the PortC / TTL bus path).",
      "confidence": 0.6
    }
  ],
